c=json.loads((r/'tools/game-series.json').read_text());c['footyphysics']={'name':'Footy Physics','symbol':'⚽','revision':'footyphysics-v1','package':['game.html','core.js','render.js','game.js'],'category':'One-button physics football','summary':'Floppy legs · first to five · random rounds · couch multiplayer','controls':'Up / W · separate Left–Right / A–D · big touch buttons','variants':[{'kicker':a,'title':b,'copy':t,'tone':'night'} for a,b,t in [('ONE BUTTON. TWO LEFT FEET.','Jump. Flop. Somehow score.','Floppy teammates, swinging legs and a real bouncing ball. First to five wins.'),('A MATCH THAT CHANGES','Slippery business. Moon league.','Eight round twists change the ground, gravity, player size, ball or goals after every score.'),('A LITTLE COUCH COMPETITION','One device. Four players.','Solo AI or local multiplayer. Control your whole team, or share the separate-player buttons with friends.'),('KITS EARNED ON THE PITCH','A team of your own.','Earn six cosmetic kits, track wins and streaks, practise physics and try three downloadable mods.')]],'features':[['Actual floppy physics','Hinged legs, rotating bodies, angular collision impulses and a bouncing ball.'],['Couch chaos','One-button or separate-player input, solo AI, two- and four-player local games, eight random round twists.'],['Big buttons, little legends','Touch and keyboard, earned cosmetic kits, saved career records, practice and three native mods.']],'mods':[['footymoon','Moon Gravity','☾','Every pitch has low gravity and longer airtime.'],['footygiant','Giant Ball','⚽','Increase the real ball collision radius by 80%.'],['footyturbo','Turbo Hops','↟','Jump and forward impulses are 35% stronger.']]};(r/'tools/game-series.json').write_text(json.dumps(c,indent=2)+'\n')
(d/'README.md').write_text('# Footy Physics\n\nOriginal 2D hinged-leg football inspired by Soccer Physics. Solo versus three AI levels, two- and four-player local multiplayer, one-button or separate-player controls. First to 3/5/7/10, eight optional random round twists, earned cosmetic kits, career stats and endless practice. Original stadium art and synthesized audio.\n\nBlue: Up/Space; red: W. Separate-player mode: blue Left/Right; red A/D. Hold to hop. Big touch buttons support independent fingers. Pause on blur or rotation.\n\nRigid bodies with SAT/circle contacts, restitution, friction, angular impulses and hinged leg constraints. Random rounds never repeat consecutively. Goal debounce, net crossbars and automatic ball nudge avoid deadlocks. Three downloadable mods change real gravity, ball geometry and hop impulses. Native offline Store package, source-checked sanitized saves and isolated modded progress. Reference: https://ottoojala.itch.io/soccer-physics.\n')
p=r/'README.md';p.write_text(p.read_text()+'\nFooty Physics adds original one-button football with hinged legs, angular collision physics, eight changing round twists, solo AI and two/four-player local play. Big touch buttons, separate-player controls, earned kits, saved career and three native mods. [Play Footy Physics](./store/footyphysics/game.html).\n')
